{"name": "Oath of the Necromancer", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"226\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3739cbac324cbe91afe4c7ecc0b08da4.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Oath of the Necromancer</strong> is a summoning-based rogue-like rooted in Greek-Egyptian myth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raise the dead, grow an army and conquer all that stands in your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raid, pillage and raise more to join your cause - the destruction of the old tyrant's forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do so in the name of Serapis - a once powerful God now in need of help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/71da9a34bc68f3ddc519badbe9f70f5f.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1048\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/71da9a34bc68f3ddc519badbe9f70f5f.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/71da9a34bc68f3ddc519badbe9f70f5f.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Amass a worthy army, up to the <strong>thousands</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raise powerful warriors, mages, archers, beasts and monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cover your armies weaknesses by strategically shaping your army. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every playthrough let's you try new combinations and variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built for replayability, each run will let you make many strategic choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will it be enough to bring down the tyrant's forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"430\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/97d4dac9939443c9a9605ef1535a5552.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/97d4dac9939443c9a9605ef1535a5552.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/97d4dac9939443c9a9605ef1535a5552.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/545bd340e92a7047cb48d9066e56cba4.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/545bd340e92a7047cb48d9066e56cba4.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/545bd340e92a7047cb48d9066e56cba4.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find new synergies every time you set foot in the tyrant's realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Recover powerful relics that grant game-changing upgrades, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">improve your necromancy, enhance your summons, or become a destructive battle-mage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return with your spoils of war to grow permanently stronger and improve your chances of slaying the old tyrant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/0655b2a007cf6800083251f76e99fc8d.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/0655b2a007cf6800083251f76e99fc8d.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/0655b2a007cf6800083251f76e99fc8d.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your people need a place to settle. Rebuild Serapis' temple, expand it,  and find yourself with more allies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help your townsfolk, mingle, and watch your community grow over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The old tyrant left many to wander the deserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"434\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1c040b62b02d445a8531bdfed9f9bea2.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1c040b62b02d445a8531bdfed9f9bea2.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1c040b62b02d445a8531bdfed9f9bea2.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3c62c1b88e29fb9cc8ae02f265b66410.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3c62c1b88e29fb9cc8ae02f265b66410.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/3c62c1b88e29fb9cc8ae02f265b66410.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Word gets around - remarkable allies may move in and aid in your cause. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find the remains of ancient heroes and bring them back to life, some of which you may remember. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find out how the heroes take their newly granted second chances, and of how much help they can be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps... you can change their fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"440\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1276e6591b229c6763d5b4a598677657.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1276e6591b229c6763d5b4a598677657.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/1276e6591b229c6763d5b4a598677657.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/fdfb3be32c00707c8c2bff6fd7e9b71a.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/fdfb3be32c00707c8c2bff6fd7e9b71a.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/fdfb3be32c00707c8c2bff6fd7e9b71a.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you streaming on <strong>Twitch</strong> and want to involve your chat? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or do you like to screen-share to your friends via <strong>Discord</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your chat and friends can join your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Connect your Twitch account and they can join by typing !join in Twitch chat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOTE: You can be <strong>offline</strong>! <i>Live Twitch stream is not needed for this to work.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">NOTE2: Interactive mechanics are planned, stay tuned for those!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"434\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/01c8702fbd223bf44685402f3c4f5e6d.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/01c8702fbd223bf44685402f3c4f5e6d.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/01c8702fbd223bf44685402f3c4f5e6d.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/cbdccf7194885df7597a440a6e3167d7.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/cbdccf7194885df7597a440a6e3167d7.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/cbdccf7194885df7597a440a6e3167d7.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is still in demo and major changes will still happen, many inspired by - <strong>YOU</strong> - the players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/719ceba95e54681758891fb0c5b682f0.webp?t=1781181351\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"293\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/d2d20c81e199c5c1aab990ed475d7f6d.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/ae3fa5de09d71b58e2fcf01be4c5392b.poster.avif?t=1781181351\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/ae3fa5de09d71b58e2fcf01be4c5392b.webm?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/ae3fa5de09d71b58e2fcf01be4c5392b.mp4?t=1781181351\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">... to know that we <strong>care</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Let us know what you think and what you would like to see. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We listen to players and always love chatting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join our community on <strong>Discord</strong>!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Raise the bones of the fallen and create an army of the undead - warriors, archers, mages, monsters & beasts. Take revenge on the old tyrant, build a sanctuary, and resurrect ancient heroes to aid in your battle. All in the name of the Greek-Egyptian God of life & death: Serapis.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/header.jpg?t=1781181351", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Bullet Heaven", "Action Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "Mythology", "Arcade"], "developers": "Nycoisdreaming, Ray Robin Vermeulen", "publishers": "Nycoisdreaming, Ray Robin Vermeulen", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2930030", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "4 April 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/aPpYhv7SeoM", "first_seen": 1743724800.0, "review_rank": 1739}